00:09:47.370 --> 00:09:49.320
Huntsville's long-range planning efforts,

00:09:49.410 --> 00:09:51.280
and whereas housing accessibility.

00:09:51.770 --> 00:09:55.510
And neighborhood stability are foundation to a thriving community.

00:09:56.010 --> 00:09:59.870
