01:25:08.320 --> 01:25:11.240
Please indicate by saying aye, aye, aye.

01:25:11.360 --> 01:25:12.370
Any opposed?

01:25:14.770 --> 01:25:15.900
Is there anyone opposed?

01:25:16.330 --> 01:25:18.150
And, uh, the motion carries.

01:25:18.250 --> 01:25:20.640
Thank you all for your vote on that.

01:25:20.690 --> 01:25:24.000
We will move to, uh, the appointment of, uh,

01:25:24.140 --> 01:25:28.920
Jim McGuffy to the position of director of Economic and Urban Development.

01:25:29.050 --> 01:25:31.200
Is there a motion to approve motion from Mr.

01:25:31.370 --> 01:25:31.720
Kling.

01:25:31.890 --> 01:25:33.440
Second from Mr.

01:25:33.650 --> 01:25:34.200
Little.

01:25:34.350 --> 01:25:35.480
Is there any discussion?

01:25:35.740 --> 01:25:36.490
Yes, Ms.

01:25:36.590 --> 01:25:38.080
Watkins, um.

01:25:39.080 --> 01:25:41.520
I too did not vote for the reorg.

01:25:42.430 --> 01:25:45.900
And the reason why I did not vote for the reorg because I did not agree

01:25:45.900 --> 01:25:47.860
