01:25:48.070 --> 01:25:49.620
I do understand some of them.

01:25:49.760 --> 01:25:51.660
Cathy's one of the exception.

01:25:52.000 --> 01:25:54.090
Jim, you're one of the exceptions as well,

01:25:54.470 --> 01:25:55.820
Scott, um.

01:25:56.540 --> 01:25:59.990
And it's, and I wanna make this clear, it's not personal,

01:26:00.500 --> 01:26:00.960
but.

01:26:01.880 --> 01:26:09.350
I know UCP got written out of the budget $0 but we gave money to Ability

01:26:09.350 --> 01:26:14.430
Plus for them to buy a heating unit, but we didn't care about kids who were

01:26:14.430 --> 01:26:15.680
