01:26:41.910 --> 01:26:44.980
And I really come in here and try to be respectful,

01:26:45.110 --> 01:26:51.220
but the disrespect be so loud sometimes in my face because the 37,000 that

01:26:51.220 --> 01:26:55.510
was taken last year from Wellstone and given to UCP,

01:26:55.830 --> 01:27:00.220
and one of the things I said was Wellstone did not have a facility in District

01:27:00.220 --> 01:27:00.620
One.

01:27:00.870 --> 01:27:05.060
So miraculously Wellstone now has a facility in District One.

01:27:05.920 --> 01:27:12.950
In which the CEO had the audacity to email me and try to be very curt.

01:27:13.650 --> 01:27:19.580
He tried to be very nasty and I still wanted funds to go to UCP not so much

01:27:19.580 --> 01:27:23.890
because of him because at the end of the day if you really care about individuals

01:27:23.950 --> 01:27:25.020
it's not personal.

01:27:25.260 --> 01:27:28.720
You would come in and do your mental health job that you should do,

01:27:28.990 --> 01:27:34.930
but instead of us giving UCP some money, we turned around and increased

01:27:35.050 --> 01:27:39.310
the amount of money for Wellstone in which they didn't deserve it.

01:27:40.830 --> 01:27:43.090
All the complaints that I hear from their employees,

01:27:43.180 --> 01:27:47.650
their employees call me and tell me that they left because of the way they're

01:27:47.650 --> 01:27:48.530
treated at Wellstone.

01:27:48.660 --> 01:27:52.140
They left because Wellstone's not doing the job that they're supposed to

01:27:52.140 --> 01:27:52.300
do.

01:27:52.500 --> 01:27:54.400
These are the phone calls I get.

01:27:54.580 --> 01:28:01.610
And when I try to get my council members to vote to give UCP $37,000 you

01:28:01.610 --> 01:28:03.890
wrote them out of the budget for $0.

01:28:04.140 --> 01:28:05.050
But like Mr.

01:28:05.220 --> 01:28:07.850
Meredith said, you come in here and you got money now.

01:28:08.660 --> 01:28:10.260
And you want me to vote for it.

01:28:10.580 --> 01:28:14.520
I voted for Cathy Martin because I understand the importance of what needs

01:28:14.540 --> 01:28:15.370
to be done.

01:28:16.040 --> 01:28:21.150
And I don't want to be that a hindrance, but it's some things I'm not gonna

01:28:21.150 --> 01:28:25.790
vote for anymore, and I'm not gonna keep trying to go along to get along

01:28:25.790 --> 01:28:30.550
because I'll be trying to get along and at the same time on the other side

01:28:30.830 --> 01:28:33.120
you just be trying to show me that you don't care.

01:28:33.930 --> 01:28:38.520
So when you show me you don't care and the disrespect is loud when you want

01:28:38.520 --> 01:28:42.930
to hire individuals and get them an increased salary who have less experience

01:28:42.930 --> 01:28:47.710
than people in the department and then you try to play in my face and tell

01:28:47.730 --> 01:28:50.450
me that they got experience when I know they don't.

01:28:51.350 --> 01:28:53.180
That right there infuriates me.

01:28:54.050 --> 01:28:55.360
So, um.

01:28:56.680 --> 01:28:58.870
This council needs to start looking at itself,

01:28:58.890 --> 01:29:00.270
and I'm talking about everybody.

01:29:01.240 --> 01:29:03.080
Because some of you don't have a heartbeat,

01:29:03.490 --> 01:29:04.760
you could care less.

01:29:05.090 --> 01:29:08.500
You're told the way to vote and you vote that way every time,

01:29:08.930 --> 01:29:10.240
and it's obvious.

01:29:11.370 --> 01:29:15.240
I came to each one of my council members individually and asked you to support

01:29:15.240 --> 01:29:17.990
UCP getting $37,000.

01:29:18.290 --> 01:29:20.000
Nope, nope, not gonna change the budget.

01:29:20.020 --> 01:29:20.880
It's already done.

01:29:21.860 --> 01:29:22.300
What?

01:29:25.380 --> 01:29:27.740
But you got money for increases in salary.

01:29:28.010 --> 01:29:32.790
We, we wanted a 4% raise for the employees that work for the city council.

01:29:32.940 --> 01:29:33.750
Nope, we don't have it.

01:29:35.130 --> 01:29:38.520
It's like when budget time come, we don't have money for the things that

01:29:38.520 --> 01:29:40.360
matter, but the things that don't matter,

01:29:40.490 --> 01:29:41.760
we have money for debt.

01:29:43.100 --> 01:29:48.370
And it's disheartening and people can say whatever they want about me.

01:29:49.230 --> 01:29:50.040
I don't care.

01:29:50.430 --> 01:29:52.350
I'm not here to be friends with anyone.

01:29:52.430 --> 01:29:53.940
I'm here to serve a district.

01:29:53.990 --> 01:29:57.860
I'm here to serve the city and sometimes we're not serving the people that

01:29:57.860 --> 01:29:59.260
we're voted to serve.

01:29:59.430 --> 01:30:04.300
We're serving individuals and companies instead of serving people where

01:30:04.300 --> 01:30:05.500
it really matters.

01:30:07.090 --> 01:30:11.710
For you to take money away from kids that are in wheelchairs that don't

01:30:11.710 --> 01:30:12.380
have.

01:30:13.310 --> 01:30:18.980
Support that the families really need and you felt $37,000 you were that

01:30:18.980 --> 01:30:22.550
petty that you kept it away from them and then I wanna know who is on this

01:30:22.550 --> 01:30:27.580
board that makes these decisions because from what I hear it's it's a committee

01:30:27.580 --> 01:30:31.370
put together but at the end of the day one person makes the decisions.

01:30:32.460 --> 01:30:36.090
And I don't understand why no council member is appointed to that committee.

01:30:36.930 --> 01:30:40.040
So they can see how it's, what's the rubric,

01:30:40.210 --> 01:30:44.350
how you determine who gets this money, all of a sudden this,

01:30:44.450 --> 01:30:47.000
uh, Wellstone gets almost a million dollars.

01:30:49.070 --> 01:30:53.250
I don't understand I don't understand a lot of things that I said last week

01:30:53.290 --> 01:30:56.140
last council meeting, so it's not a surprise.

