02:19:31.459 --> 02:19:32.920
It's a brick building.

02:19:33.219 --> 02:19:34.129
You can't get in there.

02:19:34.260 --> 02:19:36.170
Nobody has access to it.

02:19:36.660 --> 02:19:41.240
So, uh, it's not something that Community Development didn't know about.

02:19:41.379 --> 02:19:42.410
