02:21:21.580 --> 02:21:22.120
Welcome.

02:21:22.340 --> 02:21:23.090
Thank you.

02:21:24.050 --> 02:21:28.790
Um, I wanna talk about a concern that I have about the ethical standards

02:21:28.790 --> 02:21:34.150
guiding the city, the city's decisions, whose interests this council serves,

02:21:34.360 --> 02:21:38.110
and how people are chosen for positions of public responsibility.

02:21:39.030 --> 02:21:44.180
Residents deserve to know that decisions are made for the public's benefit.

02:21:45.630 --> 02:21:50.850
When personal relationships or political connections appear to carry more

02:21:50.850 --> 02:21:54.500
weight than qualifications, that undermines trust.

02:21:55.570 --> 02:21:57.120
Huntsville is growing.

02:21:57.510 --> 02:21:59.870
The responsibilities are growing with it.

02:22:00.310 --> 02:22:03.240
We need people with the experience, judgment,

02:22:03.310 --> 02:22:07.170
and skills to do the work before making appointments.

02:22:07.790 --> 02:22:12.140
This council should explain the qualifications required,

02:22:12.380 --> 02:22:17.980
how candidates were evaluated, and why the person selected is prepared to

02:22:17.980 --> 02:22:18.540
serve.

02:22:19.440 --> 02:22:23.780
Knowing the right people should never be the qualification that matters

02:22:23.780 --> 02:22:24.430
most.

02:22:25.110 --> 02:22:30.860
Residents deserve clear disclosure of potential conflicts of interest and

02:22:30.860 --> 02:22:33.840
an explanation of how those conflicts are handled.

02:22:34.590 --> 02:22:39.660
We should not have to piece together relationships to understand who benefits

02:22:39.660 --> 02:22:40.900
from a public decision.

02:22:41.880 --> 02:22:46.980
And while we're asking these questions, families are still waiting for basic

02:22:46.980 --> 02:22:47.980
services.

02:22:48.280 --> 02:22:51.460
We deserve sidewalks where children can walk safely.

02:22:51.660 --> 02:22:54.790
We deserve maintained roads, working drainage,

02:22:55.160 --> 02:22:59.300
accessible public spaces, and responsive city departments.

02:22:59.800 --> 02:23:04.140
These are basic responsibilities of local government.

02:23:05.130 --> 02:23:09.480
Every appointment, every spending decision should help the city meet those

02:23:09.480 --> 02:23:15.390
responsibilities, and I'm asking this council to make qualifications public,

02:23:16.050 --> 02:23:18.930
address potential conflicts of interest openly.

02:23:19.990 --> 02:23:24.050
And put residents' needs ahead of personal or political loyalty.

02:23:24.410 --> 02:23:27.300
Public servants are supposed to work for the public,

02:23:27.630 --> 02:23:29.470
not the other way around.

02:23:29.790 --> 02:23:32.320
A growing city deserves capable leadership,

02:23:32.510 --> 02:23:37.270
ethical decisions, and public services that people can trust.

02:23:38.840 --> 02:23:42.520
I still believe that Huntsville is underrepresented.

02:23:43.920 --> 02:23:47.540
The council is representing more than our state representatives.

02:23:48.200 --> 02:23:51.980
Please act responsibly as Huntsville grows.

02:23:52.120 --> 02:23:52.860
Thank you.

02:23:53.320 --> 02:23:53.860
Thank you.

